ch  elizabeth reflects on how much you will  miss her family and friends but she  feels that it is her destiny to follow  Mellie Otis so that they could finally  be together after 3,000 years of  suffering  who can blame them their love has  transcended time and overcome even  divine obstacles so the two of them  should definitely do whatever it takes  for them to be together meanwhile all  the sins are looking pretty glum because  of the fact that elizabeth emilio de  zara bout to leave and they asked merlin  about what the demon world is really  like merlin says that it's a polluted  land were powerful in Deraa demonic  beasts roam freely the impurities of the  demon world will rot away the souls and  bodies of members of other races except  the demons however because Elizabeth was  originally a goddess and because she  possesses unique magical abilities she  should be able to survive at least  that's what we are led to believe  although it is worth noting that the  current Elizabeth was born in a human  body so I don't know how confident I  feel that she would be able to survive  in the demon realm for an entire  lifetime nevertheless everyone has come  to accept Elizabeth's decision because  she was so steadfast and sure of herself  after she made it at first some of the  sins are surprised that Elizabeth would  be so brave and strong but Merlin  reminds them that during the last holy  war Elizabeth was part of stigma the  Alliance which fought against the demons  and hated all demons and yet Elizabeth  had the courage and strength to tell  them that Meletus the son of the demon  king is her lover and that he would be  joining their alliance now that I think  about it Elizabeth has definitely had a  lot of growth and development as a  character you could argue that at first  even though she is brave and definitely  committed to doing what's right she's  also kind of ditzy and naive however as  the story goes on and especially after  we learned her true identity 