 clans is not yet  over and even if the demon king has been  defeated for good as long as the supreme  deity continues to rule over the  celestial realm she will still want to  destroy all the demons the sins can't  expect a lasting peace by just defeating  the demon king in order to secure a  lasting peace they have to defeat the  supreme deity as well after all it takes  two to tango and both the demon king and  the supreme deity have been actively  encouraging members of their clans to  destroy each other for thousands of  years I have to admit that even though  I've been saying for a very long time  that we need to see the supreme deity  play a role in the story I was not  expecting this type of twist and I  honestly don't know what they're going  to do with Elizabeth that she actually  died meliodas now needs to wait for her  to be reincarnated again or will her  special goddess powers protect her so  she will actually survive the rubble  with maybe some injuries one thing is  for sure I can't wait to see what  happens in the next chapter let me know  what you guys think is Elizabeth really  dead and if not how do you think she  will survive also what do you think just  happened is the curse really still there  or did someone else cause the cliff to  collapse perhaps the supreme deity let  me know down in the comments I'd love to  hear from you especially now that I  myself don't know what to exactly make  of this man what a huge troll thanks  knockabout Suzuki very cool if you  enjoyed the seventh at least sense  content on this channel don't forget to  leave a like to let me know and if  you're new to anime uproar please  subscribe and hit that notification bell  also don't forget to check out our brand  new bond love the pain and esken or all  hailed the one shirts on anime out  Broadcom a huge thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons for supporting our  work and when I especially thank our pro  hero tier patrons the one and only  Gilgamesh keelon and c